=== A: round robin, free start
--- port 0
--- informal-kind, limit 10s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_hold0                      assume  unprocessed
a_wait0                      assert  proven        informal-kind
--- the rotation check: rotated requests give rotated grants
--- informal-kind, limit 10s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_rot                        assume  unprocessed
a_rot                        assert  proven        informal-kind
c_start                      cover   covered       informal-kind depth 1
--- the reset state is one of the free starts
--- informal-kind, limit 10s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
a_gnt0                       assert  proven        informal-kind
c_reset                      cover   covered       informal-kind depth 1
